{
	"$schema": "https://zed.dev/schema/themes/v0.2.0.json",
	"$comment": "Dark theme built from the Dracula Pro-style palette the user already runs in their own Ghostty config (palette 0-15, background, foreground, cursor, selection). Only those hex values are used; every other role follows the classic Dracula specification https://draculatheme.com/spec scope mapping applied to these hues. Orange (#ffca80) is the OKLCH midpoint of the palette's red and yellow; comment (#8985a5) is the palette's bright black (#504c67) lifted to WCAG AA on the background. No Dracula Pro files or assets are included.",
	"name": "Dracula Pro",
	"author": "codeatlasdev (user-supplied palette; scope mapping from the MIT-licensed Dracula spec, https://draculatheme.com/spec)",
